    "front": "TCP/IP model layers and how they map to OSI",
    "back": "- **Application** = OSI 5–7 (HTTP, DNS, SSH)\n- **Transport** = OSI 4 (TCP, UDP)\n- **Internet** = OSI 3 (IP, ICMP)\n- **Link** = OSI 1–2 (Ethernet, ARP, Wi-Fi)",
