    "domain": "D0",
    "kind": "diagram",
    "front": "TCP three-way handshake",
    "back": "Client **SYN** (seq=x) → server **SYN/ACK** (seq=y, ack=x+1) → client **ACK** (ack=y+1).\n\nA closed port answers the SYN with **RST/ACK**.",
