    "module": 0,
    "section": "Networking Essentials",
    "domain": "D0",
    "kind": "term",
    "front": "Hosts in a subnet",
    "back": "Addresses = 2^(32 − prefix). Usable hosts = 2^(32 − prefix) − 2 (network + broadcast).\n\n/24 → 254 · /26 → 62 · /27 → 30 · /29 → 6 · /30 → 2",
    "tags": [
      "subnetting",
      "ipv4"
    ],
    "sources": [
      "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4632",
