    "section": "Networking Essentials",
    "domain": "D0",
    "kind": "list",
    "front": "Key DNS record types",
    "back": "- **A / AAAA**: IPv4 / IPv6 address\n- **MX**: mail server\n- **NS**: name servers\n- **CNAME**: alias\n- **PTR**: reverse (IP → name)\n- **TXT**: SPF, DKIM, verification\n- **SOA**: zone authority and serial",
