    "section": "Networking Essentials",
    "domain": "D0",
    "kind": "list",
    "front": "DHCP: the DORA exchange",
    "back": "**D**iscover (client broadcast) → **O**ffer (server) → **R**equest (client) → **A**cknowledge (server).\n\nServer UDP **67**, client UDP **68**. Nothing authenticates the server, so rogue DHCP is possible.",
