    "module": 0,
    "section": "Operating System Essentials",
    "domain": "D0",
    "kind": "term",
    "front": "Default TTL as an OS clue",
    "back": "Typical defaults: **Linux 64**, **Windows 128**, many network devices **255**. A reply with TTL 125 suggests Windows, 3 hops away. Defaults can be changed: a hint, not proof.",
