    "section": "Security Basics",
    "domain": "D0",
    "kind": "list",
    "front": "AAA",
    "back": "- **Authentication**: prove who you are\n- **Authorization**: what you may do\n- **Accounting**: record what you did\n\nProtocols: **RADIUS** (UDP, encrypts only the password) and **TACACS+** (TCP 49, encrypts the whole body).",
