    "section": "Security Basics",
    "domain": "D0",
    "kind": "list",
    "front": "Authentication factor types",
    "back": "- Something you **know** (password, PIN)\n- Something you **have** (token, phone)\n- Something you **are** (fingerprint, face)\n\nMFA = two or more **different** types. Password + PIN is still one type.",
    "tags": [
      "authentication",
      "mfa"
