    "kind": "list",
    "front": "Controls by function",
    "back": "- **Preventive**: firewall, IPS, locks\n- **Detective**: IDS, logs, CCTV review\n- **Corrective**: patching, restoring a config\n- **Deterrent**: warning banners, visible cameras\n- **Recovery**: backups, DR site\n- **Compensating**: an alternative when the normal control is not feasible",
